---
// Homepage-only promo for the free /frequency/ tool. Placed after LearnMore and
// before FinalCta: a quiet, tool-shaped band (not a blog card, not the blue CTA)
// that signals "the team built a real free tool" for credibility, without competing
// with the primary download CTA above the fold. Landing -> tool direction, so it is
// its own component (FrequencyCta is the opposite, tool -> app).
---
<section class="sectionFrequencyPromo">
    <div class="sectionInner">
        <div class="freqPromoCard">
            <span class="freqPromoEyebrow">Free tool</span>
            <h2>The 1000 Most Common Spanish Words</h2>
            <p>
                Every word with meaning, IPA pronunciation, syllables, and stress,
                ranked by how often it appears in spoken Spanish. Built by the
                ShadowingKit team. Free, no signup, download the full list as CSV.
            </p>
            <a class="freqPromoButton" href="/frequency/" target="_self">Open the free tool →</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
